      "kern": 0
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 56,
      "y": 1260,
      "text": "Backend: all providers disabled; fresh app state; OS caches not cleared; both include the same native monitor.",
      "size": 13,
      "fill": "#929bA2",
      "weight": 400,
      "align": "left",
      "kern": 0
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 56,
      "y": 1282,
      "text": "Desktop: disconnected UI-only visibility lifecycle; not first paint, usable UI, or total app startup.",
      "size": 13,
      "fill": "#929bA2",
      "weight": 400,
      "align": "left",
      "kern": 0
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 56,
      "y": 1304,
      "text": "RPC medians pool 1,000 reads; thread creates pool 300 writes. sum RSS may count shared pages twice.",
